# measured — Ring-1 stratum: uncertain quantities (F24: the measured-literal's target)
stratum measured "Uncertain quantities. The measured-literal sugar `41.2 ±0.3 kg` compiles to this record; the unit rides the field's @unit attribute."

term epoch "The @epoch attribute key: which time origin an instant counts from."

record measured "An uncertain quantity: point estimate plus symmetric half-width. The exact expansion target of the measured-literal (F24/F29)." {
    estimate : decimal "The point estimate, canonical decimal."
    plus-minus : decimal "The symmetric half-width (±)."
}

term instant : decimal @epoch = "unix-s" "An instant in time: alias of decimal counting seconds from the attribute's epoch (round 5, answer #4 — measured exports it)."
